  {
   "text": "Five Guilds of Ravnica Guild Kits were released on November 2, 2018, a month after the release of the main set . They have an MSRP of $19.99.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Each Guild Kit features a 60-card preconstructed theme deck flavored after one of the featured guilds, combining cards from every Ravnica set released so far. The reprints are not Standard legal . The Kits are packaged with five double-sided tokens , an official guild pin, a guild sticker, a spindown life counter and an insert with mission instructions.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "All legendary cards in the Guild Kits have the new legendary card frame , and the face cards of the decks ( Trostani, Selesnya's Voice , Aurelia, the Warleader , Izoni, Thousand-Eyed , Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind and Etrata, the Silencer ) feature alternate art .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "The expansion symbol for each deck is a miniature of the corresponding guild symbol . The decks feature basic lands , with a design of the text box especially tailored to the appropriate guild. Foil versions of these lands were given out at the Ravnica Weekend .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
